OL,3,GNEWSAMP wants one train every 15       
OL,4,Aminutes to Telford                     
OL,6,FThe government is being urged to       
OL,7,Fauthorise increasing the number of     
OL,8,Ftrains between Telford and Birmingham  
OL,9,Fto one every 15 minutes.               
OL,11,FLabour MP for Telford, Shaun Davies,   
OL,12,Falso asked for fares to be cheaper and 
OL,13,Fservices made more reliable, when he   
OL,14,Fmet Transport Secretary Heidi Alexander
OL,15,Fto make his case.                      
OL,17,FHe said demand in Telford was          
OL,18,Fincreasing and more trains would "open 
OL,19,Fup a huge amount of opportunity", but  
OL,20,Fcurrently the service was "not good    
OL,21,Fenough", "overcrowded and expensive".  
