OL,3,GNEWSAMP wants one train every 15       
OL,4,Aminutes to Telford                     
OL,6,FThe Department for Transport said it   
OL,7,Fhad no response to Davies' proposal at 
OL,8,Fthis time, but passengers at Telford   
OL,9,FCentral told the BBC they agreed       
OL,10,Fimprovements were needed.              
